     6548           ACCUM SUB-TOTAL BY sj-goods.saleman sj-adv.brutto-sum-r @ sj-adv.brutto-sum-r
     6549           ACCUM SUB-TOTAL BY sj-goods.saleman sj-adv.discnt-sum @ sj-adv.discnt-sum
